 we share a special pre-recorded livestream broadcast of our Social Media and Community team playing through the demo. Will they survive everything the island has to throw at them? Or will they succumb to the parasite, doomed to sp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:44:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029087","verified_at":"2026-10-21T16:24:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2735850-1846651706691351","game_id":"steam-2735850","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo | Patch Notes","summary":"What’s changedSteam Next Fest begins from 6pm BST and we're excited to reveal that there will be an exclusive updated Wilderdark demo as part of the event.This update responds to player feedback from our early build April demo. It strengthens the intended gameplay loop, reduces opportunities to skip core content, improves navigation, and presents a more controlled slice of the full game for Steam Next Fest. Wilderdark has undergone some pretty significant changes, and there’s far too many to lis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2735850-1846018067925768","game_id":"steam-2735850","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Troubleshooting","summary":"Explorers,We have become aware of an issue affecting a small subsection of our demo players where the demo may crash when launching after updating to the latest version.If you are experiencing this issue we recommend you take the following steps:Right Click on the Demo in your Steam LibrarySelect 'Properties'Navigate to 'Installed Files'Click 'Verify Integrity of Demo Files'Allow Steam to run the file verification before attempting to relaunch the DemoIf you are still unable to play the demo aft","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:07:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2735850-1833968530898118","game_id":"steam-2735850","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update | Patch Notes","summary":"Explorers, We hope you've enjoyed your time researching the wilds of Wilderdark thus far. Though the environment and its inhabitants may be hostile, it is imperative your mission is completed successfully.To aid in you in your expedition we have provided the following updates to the Demo:World Map added to Journal.Missions correctly reset objectives if the Player dies with no Save.Collectables respawn correctly if the Player dies with no Save.Additional minor Quality Of Life adjustments.If you h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T16:26:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898118","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2735850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2735850":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2735850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z"},"2735900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:07Z"}},"context